Design origin
-------------
The mechanisms specified in SPEC.md (repository facts / micro-skills, tool pruning, and the
failure-loop guard, with their default parameters) are derived from microsoft/TokenEconomizer,
https://github.com/microsoft/TokenEconomizer, Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation, licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. Any code later ported from TokenEconomizer keeps its original
copyright notices and is marked as such.

Ported code (TokenEconomizer commit d0675a3; each file carries a header naming its TE sources):
- crates/tkm-core/src/inject.rs (microskills/distiller.py, microskills/envfacts.py, microskills/stage.py)
- crates/tkm-core/src/prune/ (toolprune/stage.py, toolprune/tools.py, plugin/denylist.py, plugin/adapter.py, plugin/fold.py)

Third-party agent skills
------------------------
The directory .agents/skills/ contains skills copied from third-party repositories under their
own licenses (MIT and Apache-2.0). Each skill directory carries its license file or license note,
and .agents/skills/README.md lists the source URL and commit of each one.
